        <mxCell id="n27" value='How to use:  open this file in draw.io (or VS Code + Draw.io Integration).&lt;br&gt;1. Go to the A3 SHEET tab.&lt;br&gt;2. Copy a symbol from this LIBRARY tab and paste it on the sheet.&lt;br&gt;3. Join symbols with connectors (drag from the blue arrow until it turns green) - the line then follows the symbol when you move it.&lt;br&gt;4. Run  python sld_generator.py --feeder "Mandli F13" --geo  for a sheet placed by GPS.&lt;br&gt;5. File &gt; Export as &gt; PDF (A3 landscape) for the signed copy.' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="780.0" width="760.0" height="140.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
